msgid ""
"The **StrobeIT** is a high-intensity, standalone or PWM-controlled LED "
"strobe designed by **TeraVolt Labs**. It is engineered for long-range "
"visibility and DGCA/FAA compliance for night operations."
msgstr ""
"**StrobeIT** 是由 **TeraVolt Labs** 设计的高亮度 LED 爆闪灯，可独立工作或通过 PWM "
"控制。它专为远距离可见性以及夜间飞行的 DGCA/FAA 合规性而设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StrobeIT.rst:13 54a2d79755b1412884316298aba1ed6c
